      <title>吉隆口岸泥石流痕迹高达20层楼，救援难点远超常规预判</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260831/%E5%90%89%E9%9A%86%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E6%B3%A5%E7%9F%B3%E6%B5%81%E7%97%95%E8%BF%B9%E9%AB%98%E8%BE%BE20%E5%B1%82%E6%A5%BC%E6%95%91%E6%8F%B4%E9%9A%BE%E7%82%B9%E8%BF%9C%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%84%E9%A2%84%E5%88%A4/</link>
